<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, 11 March 1997 - Salomon Inc has issued 50,000 European-style LEPOs (Low Exercise Price Option), on Nestle, lead manager Salon Brothers International said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    **			  ISSUE PRICE  1,495.15 CHF</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   18.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	24.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,649.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	   **LONG CALL STRIKE PRICE IS 0.01 CHF, SHORT CALL</p>
<p>		     STRIKE PRICE IS 1,600.00 CHF. THE SHORT CALL</p>
<p>		     STRIKE PRICE MAY BE ADJUSTED IN ACCORDANCE WITH</p>
<p>		     THE TERMS OF THE WARRANTS</p>
<p>		     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  SAZQ</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
